25
00:00:54,243 --> 00:00:56,145
-They know.
-Who's "they"?

26
00:00:56,245 --> 00:00:58,046
[Josie]
CIA

27
00:00:58,147 --> 00:00:59,748
Special Activities.

28
00:00:59,848 --> 00:01:02,351
-[gasps]
-The mission is to show Iran

29
00:01:02,451 --> 00:01:05,854
