only nation with an open border.

30
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:08,357
Do not get yourself caught.

31
00:01:08,423 --> 00:01:10,225
Everyone's watching
on this one.

32
00:01:10,325 --> 00:01:11,926
Am I a part of this?

33
00:01:12,026 --> 00:01:13,328
You're the part.

34
00:01:13,428 --> 00:01:15,964
We're gonna find out
how well you fly.

35
00:01:16,064 --> 00:01:17,499
