122
00:04:28,657 --> 00:04:30,992
I'm saving all my love
for you, Daddy.

123
00:04:32,561 --> 00:04:34,429
-Ew! [groans]
-All right. Gross.

124
00:04:34,529 --> 00:04:35,930
-Gross.
-[Joe] Okay.

125
00:04:35,997 --> 00:04:37,566
-Fine, fine, fine.
-Oh, okay. All right, all right.

126
00:04:37,666 --> 00:04:39,067
-[Kate] Bye, Mom, love you.
-[Charlie] Bye, Mom.

127
00:04:39,133 --> 00:04:41,336
All right, all right.
Finish up. We got to go.

128
