and who trained them.

139
00:05:12,867 --> 00:05:14,903
-Just follow the money.
-Yeah.

140
00:05:15,003 --> 00:05:17,772
Qatar alone has donated
over $11 billion dollars

141
00:05:17,872 --> 00:05:19,674
