142
00:05:20,575 --> 00:05:24,813
China has donated
$2.3 billion since 2012,

143
00:05:24,913 --> 00:05:27,682
with $12 billion in tuition paid

144
00:05:27,816 --> 00:05:31,453
for Chinese nationals
at our universities.

145
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:34,956
And you're surprised that
graduates of those schools are

146
00:05:35,023 --> 00:05:37,358
espousing communist agendas

147
00:05:37,459 --> 00:05:40,094
and declaring
democracy is dying?

148
00:05:41,129 --> 00:05:43,131
That's what
they were trained to say.

149
00:05:43,197 --> 00:05:44,866
Doesn't scare you even a little?

150
00:05:44,966 --> 00:05:46,267
Fool's gold, honey.

151
00:05:46,367 --> 00:05:49,538
You want to scare me,
start talking about AI.

152
00:05:49,671 --> 00:05:51,740
That's the real end
of democracy.

153
00:05:51,873 --> 00:05:53,642
-[phone buzzing]
-Oh.

154
00:05:53,742 --> 00:05:55,043
Hey, you on your way in?

155
00:05:55,143 --> 00:05:56,511
I'll be there in 30. You?

156
00:05:56,611 --> 00:05:58,379
