Well, you know the deal.

161
00:06:04,318 --> 00:06:05,253
A lot of red tape

162
00:06:05,353 --> 00:06:06,721
on this side of the fence.

163
00:06:06,821 --> 00:06:08,923
[tires screeching]

164
00:06:09,591 --> 00:06:10,725
[car honks]

165
00:06:10,859 --> 00:06:12,393
-Oh, nice.
-[Meade] What's nice?

166
00:06:12,494 --> 00:06:14,262
[grunts]

167
00:06:16,197 --> 00:06:19,968
Shit! I'm blackjacked!
I'm blackjacked!

168
00:06:23,538 --> 00:06:25,006
[Meade]
Joe?

169
00:06:25,106 --> 00:06:26,407
Joe?

170
00:06:26,508 --> 00:06:28,176
[groans]

171
00:06:28,242 --> 00:06:29,944
[screams]

172
00:06:31,079 --> 00:06:33,948
[screams] Damn it! No!

173
00:06:34,048 --> 00:06:35,750
[grunting]

174
00:06:35,884 --> 00:06:37,752
[Meade]
Blackjack on Raven.

175
00:06:37,852 --> 00:06:40,254
Blackjack on Raven,
unfolding in real time.

176
00:06:40,353 --> 00:06:43,925
Access beacon. Send all assets
to last known location.

177
00:06:44,058 --> 00:06:45,894
