more than they watch you.

201
00:10:04,893 --> 00:10:06,761
We've been looking for a way
since the war started.

202
00:10:06,828 --> 00:10:08,730
An opportunity appeared,
I took it.

203
00:10:08,797 --> 00:10:09,764
Okay.

204
00:10:09,864 --> 00:10:12,133
What are you gonna do about it?

205
00:10:13,467 --> 00:10:14,969
Aleksi Yurimov.

206
00:10:15,069 --> 00:10:17,906
I'm sorry. I'm not up
on my Russian spies.

207
00:10:17,972 --> 00:10:19,640
The Middle East is my theater.

208
00:10:19,741 --> 00:10:21,342
