-Yes.

209
00:10:21,475 --> 00:10:22,643
He runs it.

210
00:10:23,444 --> 00:10:26,881
He's moved to the front.
I have his location.

211
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:32,153
Okay. Yay for you.

212
00:10:33,121 --> 00:10:34,923
We want you to have him.

213
00:10:35,757 --> 00:10:37,658
Why would we want that?

214
00:10:38,793 --> 00:10:41,162
Leverage. Maybe you trade him.

215
00:10:42,764 --> 00:10:44,665
Why would you want that?

216
00:10:45,499 --> 00:10:46,935
He's Putin's hammer.

217
00:10:47,001 --> 00:10:50,939
If we kill him, Putin's
retaliation will be severe.

218
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:53,374
But if you take him,
it's just the game.

219
00:10:53,507 --> 00:10:56,310
And a big risk to a unit
or a Ground Branch detail

220
00:10:56,410 --> 00:10:57,946
