-Recruitment and infiltration.

228
00:11:16,998 --> 00:11:18,399
You know honeypot?

229
00:11:18,532 --> 00:11:21,870
Mm. I know honeypot.

230
00:11:21,970 --> 00:11:24,438
I hold the jar.

231
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:27,375
