232
00:11:27,475 --> 00:11:29,543
Give me your number.
I'll have someone con--

233
00:11:29,677 --> 00:11:31,679
Not on your fucking life.

234
00:11:31,746 --> 00:11:35,984
You give contact to me,
and we'll reach out. Maybe.

235
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:37,285
[Oleksandra sighs]

236
00:11:40,188 --> 00:11:42,891
Only good for a week.

237
00:11:48,096 --> 00:11:51,900
If we're interested,
we'll be in touch.

238
