244
00:12:33,975 --> 00:12:36,277
[groans]
You got to be kidding me, boss.

245
00:12:36,377 --> 00:12:39,981
Uh, you know, Ukraine is on the
bucket list there, chief-eroni.

246
00:12:40,081 --> 00:12:41,816
Yeah, I think it is now.

247
00:12:41,916 --> 00:12:43,952
