678
00:44:02,328 --> 00:44:05,597
Across the hall, they said.

679
00:44:11,037 --> 00:44:14,673
Seen a lot of crazy shit, boss.
What the hell?

680
00:44:14,774 --> 00:44:16,342
Not here, Bobby.

681
00:44:16,408 --> 00:44:18,811
Fucking robots and drones
and shit.

682
00:44:18,878 --> 00:44:20,546
Not here.

683
00:44:22,381 --> 00:44:23,582
